    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max saved the day, and maybe he even meant what he said. That's all for this episode. Goodbye! Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'here' and 'to do' — you will catch every word right away. See you in the next scene.",
      "gap": 0.5
